<title>USA: Unitrin completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Unitrin completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unitrin Inc said Tuesday it completed the previously announced acquisition of  Union Automobile Indemnity Co. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Union Automobile wrote direct premiums for the 12-month period ending September 30, 1996 of about $37 million.</p>
<p>Unitrin is engaged in property and casualty insurance.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
